    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hashing</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Frequency count</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/valid-anagram/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 242</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Valid Anagram</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Two strings are anagrams when they hold the same letters with the same counts. One array of 26 counters: +1 for each letter of s, -1 for each letter of t, then check that everything is back to 0. O(n) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
